20:33.900 --> 20:37.070
There couldn't have been a more
 perfect result, could there?

20:38.920 --> 20:43.090
Well? Are you ready to tell us 
exactly what's going on, Akizuki?

20:43.670 --> 20:47.960
This was... the most important thing to me.

20:47.960 --> 20:50.600
I haven't told anyone else until now.

20:50.960 --> 20:55.720
But I guess I'll talk. This might 
be the last chance I get, anyway.

20:56.030 --> 20:57.220
The last chance?

20:57.220 --> 20:59.690
I'm kind of smart, you see.

20:59.690 --> 21:03.190
I took something called an intellectual 
development test and got an incredible score.

21:03.190 --> 21:05.150
One of the best scores ever.

21:05.150 --> 21:08.230
Then I was headhunted to come 
to grade school on Academy Island.

21:08.230 --> 21:11.250
Yeah, I think that's a lot 
more than "kind of smart."

21:11.250 --> 21:16.590
But grade schools on this island really 
only accept the most elite candidates.

21:16.590 --> 21:22.200
Intelligence and talent aren't enough. 
You need to be from a good family and lineage.

21:22.200 --> 21:26.890
There's no way a normal person like me 
could blend in at a place like that.

21:26.890 --> 21:31.080
I couldn't help feeling 
like I was worthless.

21:31.080 --> 21:36.970
So I thought if I stopped being so normal...
 If I became someone great, I could fit in here.

21:37.390 --> 21:39.910
So I worked really hard.

21:39.910 --> 21:44.740
In my first year, I got into the top class,
 and last year, I became a Five Star.

21:44.740 --> 21:49.690
Everyone said I'd win the All-Campus 
Elimination Battle and become Eimei's ace!

21:49.690 --> 21:57.030
I wanted <i>something</i>. Just one reward 
to show for all the effort I'd put in.

21:57.030 --> 21:59.730
I wanted to become special.

21:59.730 --> 22:03.840
But you took that all away 
from me, Hiroto-kun.

22:03.840 --> 22:05.790
You destroyed me in an instant.

22:06.150 --> 22:09.800
Is that why you made a deal 
with this "devil" guy?

22:10.370 --> 22:13.280
The devil's name is Kurahashi Mikado.

22:13.280 --> 22:15.820
He's the headmaster of 
Seijo Academy in District 12.

22:15.820 --> 22:20.120
He told me to cheat and do whatever 
I could to steal Stars from you, Hiroto-kun.

22:20.120 --> 22:23.830
If I did that, he said he'd make
 all my dreams come true!

22:24.190 --> 22:26.060
I was so scared.

22:26.600 --> 22:30.240
Everything fell apart just as I was 
about to be rewarded for my hard work.

22:30.550 --> 22:34.450
Didn't you ever think of defying him? 
This Kurahashi guy, I mean.

22:34.450 --> 22:38.360
There's no way! I'm no match for him.

22:38.650 --> 22:42.470
But it's fine. You can all 
just forget about me.

22:42.470 --> 22:47.610
I'm sure this is my last day at school here 
and the last time I'll ever see you, Hiroto-kun.

22:48.550 --> 22:53.750
There's just one more thing. I'm really 
sorry I tried to hurt your Maid-chan.

22:54.340 --> 22:56.130
<i>I'm not okay with this. Gimme a break!</i>

22:56.490 --> 22:59.020
Who said you could just give up?

22:59.360 --> 23:03.070
B-But there's nothing else I can do!

23:03.070 --> 23:06.280
Where will I ever find anyone
who's able to defeat that devil?

23:06.280 --> 23:11.540
Yeah, that's the problem. You can't see it
 because you're always looking down.

23:12.980 --> 23:16.380
Did you forget? 
I'm the strongest on Academy Island.

23:17.160 --> 23:19.990
I don't care if this guy's 
a District 12 headmaster.

23:20.340 --> 23:21.790
A loser like that...

23:23.240 --> 23:24.670
is no match for me.

23:25.840 --> 23:27.320
Hiroto-kun?

23:29.650 --> 23:33.460
Don't worry. I won this 
game a long time ago.

23:34.230 --> 23:37.680
So, the thing you should 
know is, you've been saved.
